# Every checkout writes the bytes the repository stores, LF, on every platform:
# a Windows checkout would otherwise write CRLF, and the gate's hashes and byte
# comparisons would read bytes the repository never held (spec 312). This rule
# comes first and no later rule sets eol or text.
* text=auto eol=lf
# The binary file types this repository tracks, declared by type: one extension per line.
# Every other tracked file is text, and carries no NUL byte.
*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
